OL,3,GNEWSAEx-pupil's world record tyre flip
OL,4,Abid for school
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fitness instructor is aiming to spend
OL,7,F24 hours flipping a 100kg (220lbs) tyre
OL,8,Fin a record-breaking bid inspired by
OL,9,Fgratitude to his former school in
OL,10,FEpsom.
OL,12,FJames Farmer, who left Glyn School in
OL,13,F2001, said he had spent more than 20
OL,14,Fyears working in health and fitness,
OL,15,Fincluding training elite athletes and
OL,16,FOlympians.
OL,18,FHowever, he credits much of that
OL,19,Fsuccess to the support he received at
OL,20,FGlyn and hopes his challenge will raise
OL,21,F#20,000 towards a new sports pavilion.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
